WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.350
Big choice you keep putting off?

2
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.250
Round and round... and round.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.100
[sighs]

4
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.980
Quorum hands it to a council
of seven minds,

5
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.700
each with its own view.

6
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.150
They argue it out,
then they vote,

7
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.880
to get one clear answer,
and next steps.

8
00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.350
Stop overthinking.

9
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.900
Let the council decide.

10
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.200
Type /quorum in Claude Code.

11
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:22.600
Right now.
